input.command:
cd /home/vscode/basis-experiment && git add basis/ && git commit -m "basis experiment: one slice per foundational format, interlocked on the stakeholder-presentation domain

Slices: principles (TOGAF 4-part + BCP14 + composed fitness screen applied);
